--- !u!114 &39946344
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 39946342}
  m_Enabled: 0
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f60aa0bf21144c0449404908e3253a24, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DisplayOnStart: 0
  titleText: {fileID: 2055059703}
  shortStatementText: {fileID: 144923526}
  segments:
  - title: Sit confortably (1/4)
    shortStatement: "<b>Sit in a quiet, comfy spot</b>. Make sure you\u2019ll be
      able to lie down straight later, without turning your body."
    buttonSet: {fileID: 479276130}
  - title: Adjust position (2/4)
    shortStatement: Ready? <b>Sit straight, face forward</b>, and <b>click to align
      your position</b>.
    buttonSet: {fileID: 74010068}
  - title: Readjust position (3/4)
    shortStatement: To readjust your position anytime, <b>hold the trigger button
      for 3s</b> to open the menu, go to the <b>Settings</b> and choose <b>Adjust
      Position</b>.
    buttonSet: {fileID: 876959170}
  - title: Record data (4/4)
    shortStatement: "\nIf you wish to record the data from the moon trip (stillness
      training), please enter your ID and session number. The file will be stored
      on the headset in: \n/sdcard/Android/data/com.douglasresearch.missioncontrol/files/\n\n\n\nBy
      starting the recording, I consent to my data being recorded (time spent holding
      the moon on target or off target)."
    buttonSet: {fileID: 1201230039}
  segmentsFR:
  - title: Position assise (1/4)
    shortStatement: "<b>Assieds-toi dans un endroit calme et confortable</b>. Assure-toi
      de pouvoir t\u2019allonger ensuite en ligne droite, sans avoir \xE0 tourner
      ton corps."
    buttonSet: {fileID: 479276130}
  - title: Ajuste ta position (2/4)
    shortStatement: "Pr\xEAt(e) ? <b>Assieds-toi droit(e), regarde droit devant</b>,
      puis <b>clique pour aligner ta position</b>."
    buttonSet: {fileID: 74010068}
  - title: "R\xE9ajuster ta position (3/4)"
    shortStatement: "Pour r\xE9ajuster ta position \xE0 tout moment, <b>maintiens
      la g\xE2chette pendant 3 s</b> pour ouvrir le menu, va dans les <b>Param\xE8tres</b>
      et choisis <b>Ajuster la position</b>."
    buttonSet: {fileID: 876959170}
  - title: "Enregistrer les donn\xE9es (4/4)"
    shortStatement: "Si tu souhaites enregistrer les donn\xE9es de ton voyage lunaire
      (entra\xEEnement \xE0 l\u2019immobilit\xE9), entre ton ID et ton num\xE9ro
      de session. Le fichier sera sauvegard\xE9 sur le casque dans :\n/sdcard/Android/data/com.douglasresearch.missioncontrol/files/\n\n\n\nEn
      d\xE9marrant l\u2019enregistrement, je consens \xE0 ce que mes donn\xE9es soient
      enregistr\xE9es (temps o\xF9 j'ai gard\xE9 la lune sur la cible ou hors cible)."
    buttonSet: {fileID: 1201230039}
